r's father\n   - Location: Character alias resolution still failing for familial descriptors despite Attempt 2 fix\n   - Impact: -1.5 points (core character fragmented)\n\n2. **Missing character: William Frankenstein**\n   - Evidence: Appears in chapter summaries, murdered in Chapter 8, but NO character profile\n   - Location: Character profile threshold filtering\n   - Impact: -0.8 points (major plot character missing)\n\n3. **Pronunciation false positives render guide unusable**\n   - Problem: Common words flagged (my, father, man, old, young, child, mother, girl, woman, stranger, creator, magistrate)\n   - Evidence: 663 total flags, estimated 400+ are false positives\n   - Location: Pronunciation agent filtering\n   - Impact: -0.7 points (primary deliverable severely degraded)\n\n### HIGH\n\n4. **Multiple title/honorific splits**\n   - \"Walton\" (6) vs \"Captain Walton\" (1)\n   - \"Clerval\" (55) vs \"M. Clerval\" (2)\n   - \"Krempe\" (1) vs \"M. Krempe\" (8)\n   - Impact: -0.4 points\n\n5. **Nonsense character \"M.\" with 23 mentions**\n   - Evidence: Incomplete name extraction\n   - Should not exist as standalone character\n   - Impact: -0.3 points\n\n6. **Caroline Frankenstein split**\n   - \"my mother\" (10) vs \"Madame Frankenstein\" (1)\n   - Impact: -0.2 points\n\n### MEDIUM\n\n7. **De Lacey split**\n   - \"De Lacey\" (9), \"De\" (6), \"old man\" (2)\n   - Impact: -0.1 points\n\nNow let me update the EVALUATION_STATE.md:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":720,"cache_read_input_tokens":59426,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":720,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3582466a-8dce-4f4d-be43-a500700e25bc","uuid":"1233aec5-ff5a-4bc5-8ede-f7a588b4fc1b"}
